@startuml web-components
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

package "FastAPI 应用" as FastAPI {
    [main.py] as Main
    [routes.py] as Routes
    [models.py] as Models
    [templates_config.py] as TemplatesConfig
}

package "前端" as Frontend {
    [HTMX] as HTMX
    [Alpine.js] as Alpine
    [Tailwind CSS] as Tailwind
}

package "模板" as Templates {
    [base.html] as Base
    [digest.html] as Digest
    [profile.html] as Profile
    [archive.html] as Archive
    [partials/*.html] as Partials
}

package "核心库" as Core {
    [glean/core.py] as CoreLib
}

Main --> Routes : 注册路由
Routes --> Models : Pydantic 校验
Routes --> TemplatesConfig : 模板渲染
Routes --> CoreLib : 业务逻辑
Routes --> HTMX : 返回 HTML 片段
TemplatesConfig --> Templates : Jinja2 渲染
HTMX --> Alpine : 客户端交互
Alpine --> Tailwind : 样式

note right of Routes
  路由分类：
  - HTML 页面: /digest, /profile, /archive
  - API: /api/papers, /api/feedback
  - HTMX: /htmx/paper-list
end note

@enduml
